# Poker chip, rolling: a giant red poker chip (poker_chip_red), 2.4 m across, rolling away on its edge, its faces to +z and -z,
# leaning a little as it starts to fall. Its rim is sunk a few centimetres into the ground.
format 1
collider convex

# Half the vertices its size would give it, and its parts half too: big, simple forms, and dozens of game pieces lie on the
# board
Detail detail=0.5
    Translate translation=(0, 1.16, 0)
        # On its edge (a quarter turn about x stands the flat chip up), then leaning 12° towards +z
        Rotate rotation=(1.3613568, 0, 0)
            Part part=poker_chip_red
